---
import DashboardLayout from "../../../layouts/DashboardLayout.astro";
import {
  pisCofinsCST04RevenueNatureReferences,
  pisCofinsCST05RevenueNatureReferences,
  pisCofinsCST06RevenueNatureReferences,
} from "../../../lib/pis-cofins-revenue-natures";

const modules = [
  {
    eyebrow: "Enquadramento contributivo",
    title: "CST e regime",
    description:
      "Separe claramente CST de PIS/COFINS, regime normal ou presumido e reaproveitamento vindo da nota de entrada.",
    links: [
      { href: "/admin/cst", label: "CST de PIS/COFINS", copy: "Cadastre CST de entrada e saida com contexto operacional." },
      { href: "/admin/legal-rules", label: "Regras tributarias", copy: "Refine a aplicacao por NCM, CFOP, UFs, regime e vigencia." },
    ],
  },
  {
    eyebrow: "Receitas e aliquotas",
    title: "Aliquotas e codigos de receita",
    description:
      "Controle aliquotas de PIS e COFINS por regime, alem dos codigos de receita usados para leitura e sugestao.",
    links: [
      { href: "/admin/cst", label: "Aliquotas e receita", copy: "Use o cadastro guiado para manter CST, aliquotas e receitas." },
      { href: "/produtos", label: "Produtos", copy: "Revise como o perfil do produto esta consolidado para contribuicoes." },
    ],
  },
  {
    eyebrow: "Consulta e validacao",
    title: "Motor e simulacao",
    description:
      "Acompanhe como as contribuicoes aparecem na consulta e valide se o reaproveitamento da entrada pode ou nao seguir para a saida.",
    links: [
      { href: "/simulacao", label: "Consulta tributaria", copy: "Confira rapidamente PIS e COFINS sugeridos no painel final." },
      { href: "/invoices", label: "Notas importadas", copy: "Use CST e aliquotas capturados na entrada como apoio a decisao." },
    ],
  },
];

const highlights = [
  "CST PIS",
  "CST COFINS",
  "Aliquota regime normal",
  "Aliquota lucro presumido",
  "Receita de PIS",
  "Receita de COFINS",
  "Memoria de entrada x saida",
];
---

<DashboardLayout
  title="PIS e COFINS"
  subtitle="Central de gestao de PIS e COFINS com CST, aliquotas por regime e receitas"
>
  <section class="tax-hub-hero">
    <div class="tax-hub-hero__copy">
      <span class="tax-hub-hero__eyebrow">Contribuicoes federais</span>
      <h2>Organize PIS e COFINS com mais clareza operacional</h2>
      <p>
        Esta aba separa enquadramento, aliquotas e receitas de PIS/COFINS para facilitar a leitura
        do time. O objetivo e tirar esse assunto do meio das demais regras e deixar a manutencao
        mais objetiva.
      </p>

      <div class="tax-hub-tags">
        {highlights.map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tax-hub-hero__panel">
      <article class="tax-hub-stat">
        <span>Frentes de gestao</span>
        <strong>3 blocos</strong>
        <p>Enquadramento, aliquotas/receitas e validacao na consulta.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tax-hub-stat tax-hub-stat--accent">
        <span>Foco operacional</span>
        <strong>Regime + saida</strong>
        <p>Ajuda a separar o que pode ser reutilizado da entrada do que precisa regra especifica de saida.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tax-hub-reference">
    <div class="tax-hub-reference__header">
      <div>
        <span class="tax-hub-card__eyebrow">Natureza da receita</span>
        <h3>CST 06 - Aliquota zero</h3>
      </div>
      <a
        class="tax-hub-reference__link"
        href="https://ajuda.alterdata.com.br/wfiscal/layout-importacao-sped/3-anexos/3-13-anexo-xiii-natureza-da-receita-pis-cofins-cst-06"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        Ver referencia
      </a>
    </div>
    <p>
      Quando PIS/COFINS estiverem com CST 06, a natureza da receita deixa de ser opcional para
      decisao fiscal segura. Cadastre o codigo correto junto da regra legal, em vez de reaproveitar
      aliquotas de CST 01/02.
    </p>
    <div class="revenue-reference-grid">
      {pisCofinsCST06RevenueNatureReferences.map((item) => (
        <article>
          <span>{item.category}</span>
          <strong>{item.code} - {item.title}</strong>
          <p>{item.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tax-hub-reference tax-hub-reference--mono">
    <div class="tax-hub-reference__header">
      <div>
        <span class="tax-hub-card__eyebrow">Natureza da receita</span>
        <h3>CST 04 - Revenda monofasica</h3>
      </div>
      <a
        class="tax-hub-reference__link"
        href="https://ajuda.alterdata.com.br/wfiscal/layout-importacao-sped/3-anexos/3-11-anexo-xi-natureza-da-receita-pis-cofins-cst-04"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        Ver referencia
      </a>
    </div>
    <p>
      Use CST 04 para revenda de produto monofasico com aliquota zero. Para bebidas frias, a tabela
      separa codigos especificos, como `406` para cervejas e cervejas sem alcool, e `499` para
      revenda residual de bebidas frias.
    </p>
    <div class="revenue-reference-grid">
      {pisCofinsCST04RevenueNatureReferences.map((item) => (
        <article>
          <span>{item.category}</span>
          <strong>{item.code} - {item.title}</strong>
          <p>{item.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tax-hub-reference tax-hub-reference--st">
    <div class="tax-hub-reference__header">
      <div>
        <span class="tax-hub-card__eyebrow">Natureza da receita</span>
        <h3>CST 05 - Substituicao tributaria</h3>
      </div>
      <a
        class="tax-hub-reference__link"
        href="https://ajuda.alterdata.com.br/wfiscal/layout-importacao-sped/3-anexos/3-12-anexo-xii-natureza-da-receita-pis-cofins-cst-05"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        Ver referencia
      </a>
    </div>
    <p>
      Use CST 05 quando a contribuicao estiver enquadrada como substituicao tributaria de
      PIS/COFINS. O codigo `999` cobre revenda de produtos sujeitos a ST, enquanto `407` e `408`
      aparecem para bebidas frias e embalagens em operacoes monofasicas destinadas a ZFM.
    </p>
    <div class="revenue-reference-grid">
      {pisCofinsCST05RevenueNatureReferences.map((item) => (
        <article>
          <span>{item.category}</span>
          <strong>{item.code} - {item.title}</strong>
          <p>{item.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tax-hub-grid">
    {modules.map((module) => (
      <article class="tax-hub-card" data-filter-item>
        <header class="tax-hub-card__header">
          <span class="tax-hub-card__eyebrow">{module.eyebrow}</span>
          <h3>{module.title}</h3>
          <p>{module.description}</p>
        </header>

        <div class="tax-hub-card__links">
          {module.links.map((link) => (
            <a class="tax-hub-link" href={link.href}>
              <strong>{link.label}</strong>
              <p>{link.copy}</p>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </section>

  <style>
    .tax-hub-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(280px, 0.75fr);
      gap: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 26px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(219, 228, 238, 0.92);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.12), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.12), transparent 26%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98), rgba(255, 249, 252, 0.98));
      box-shadow: 0 20px 44px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .tax-hub-hero__copy {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .tax-hub-hero__eyebrow,
    .tax-hub-card__eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.12);
      color: #9f1239;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .tax-hub-hero h2,
    .tax-hub-card h3 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .tax-hub-hero p,
    .tax-hub-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .tax-hub-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .tax-hub-tags span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(186, 200, 214, 0.82);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .tax-hub-hero__panel {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .tax-hub-stat {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .tax-hub-stat span {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .tax-hub-stat strong {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
    }

    .tax-hub-stat--accent {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 241, 242, 0.98), rgba(255, 247, 250, 0.98));
      border-color: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.2);
    }

    .tax-hub-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .tax-hub-reference {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.18);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.16), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #fff7ed);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }

    .tax-hub-reference--mono {
      border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.16), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #eff6ff);
    }

    .tax-hub-reference--st {
      border-color: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.22);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.16), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #ecfeff);
    }

    .tax-hub-reference__header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .tax-hub-reference__header h3 {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .tax-hub-reference > p {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 980px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .tax-hub-reference__link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.28);
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #9f1239;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .revenue-reference-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .revenue-reference-grid article {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.14);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .revenue-reference-grid span {
      color: #9f1239;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .revenue-reference-grid strong {
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .revenue-reference-grid p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.55;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .tax-hub-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(219, 228, 238, 0.92);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.08), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #fff9fc);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }

    .tax-hub-card__header {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .tax-hub-card__links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .tax-hub-link {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(186, 200, 214, 0.82);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease,
        border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .tax-hub-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-color: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.24);
    }

    .tax-hub-link strong {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .tax-hub-hero,
      .tax-hub-card__links,
      .revenue-reference-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</DashboardLayout>
